# GitHub language statistics
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub sizes each language by bytes. Notebooks are mostly saved
# chart outputs and embedded images (about 10 MB, of which under
# 9 KB is code), so they would otherwise show as ~99% of the repo.
*.ipynb linguist-detectable=false

# Helper file provided by the module, not my own code
**/lab_toolkit.py linguist-vendored

# Platform boilerplate generated by `flutter create`
**/fuel_cost_share_app/android/** linguist-generated
**/fuel_cost_share_app/web/** linguist-generated
